 of the vienna congress on the european system and the non european world quot 2024 historiografische studies university of nottingham repository quot the congress of vienna 1814 1815 diplomacy political culture and sociability quot 2015 english historical review quot a priceless grace the congress of vienna of 1815 the ottoman empire and the question of the eastern question quot 2021 database multiple peer reviewed articles on congress of vienna and napoleonic legacy alle bronnen geraadpleegd tussen augustus 2025 academische bronnen geselecteerd op basis van peer review status en reputatie van uitgever instelling cobban alfred dictatorship its history and theory london jonathan cape 1939 republished in napoleon interpretations various authors educational press 1940s broers michael napoleon soldier of destiny london faber amp faber 2014 available at gordley james quot myths of the french civil code quot american journal of comparative law 42 no 3 1994 459 505 referenced in li zilei and carlos hernández quot the overemphasized legacy of the napoleonic code quot journal of student research 10 no 2 2021 carbonnier jean droit civil paris puf 2004 referenced in quot code civil quot max eup 2012 max planck institute for comparative and international private law 2021 broers michael europe under napoleon 1799 1815 london arnold 2009 jarrett mark the congress of vienna and its legacy war and great power diplomacy after napoleon london i b tauris 2013 zamoyski adam phantom terror political paranoia and the creation of the modern state 1789 1848 new york basic books 2014 quot the congress of vienna 1814 15 quot magadh mahila college educational materials 2020 available at vick brian the congress of vienna power and politics after napoleon cambridge ma harvard university press 2014 geraadpleegde bronnen hoofdstuk 3 primaire bronnen locke john 1689 two treatises of government awnsham churchill smith adam 1776 an inquiry into the nature and causes of the wealth of nations w strah